<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="How StripUnion uses affiliate links and separates commercial referrals from editorial coverage.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell narrow"><span class="kicker">Affiliate disclosure</span><h1>Some StripUnion links can earn a commission.</h1><p class="lead">This funding model helps support the site, but commercial links are labeled and separated from ordinary editorial navigation.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section shell narrow article-body">
    <h2>How affiliate links work</h2><p>When you click a clearly identified affiliate link and complete a qualifying action on a third-party site, StripUnion may receive compensation. The third party, not StripUnion, controls its current eligibility rules, prices, products and terms.</p>
    <h2>Current partner links</h2><p>Stripchat is currently the approved commercial partner used on the migrated site. On a review of another brand, any Stripchat commercial button is labeled as a partner alternative rather than presented as a link to the reviewed brand.</p>
    <h2>Editorial separation</h2><p>Affiliate availability does not convert an editorial review into a paid ranking. StripUnion does not publish fabricated ratings or imply that a commercial relationship proves a platform is superior.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
